> Hmm, I don't think I used the right modal connective there.

Doesn't parse. It's equivalent to "pu do zo'e cuxna ki'u ko zo'e na troci", 
which means "before you (something) chooses because of you (something) 
doesn't try". If you place "i" before "ki'u", it parses, but doesn't make 
much sense.

